Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|ignore.errors|Plugin security management is not enabled. Enable a security manager, then restart.|
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|testray.component.names|Upgrades WEM,Web Content Administration|
		|testray.main.component.name|Upgrades WEM|

Set Up: This executes before each scenario 
	Given SignIn sign In
	When Smoke view Welcome Page
	Then Upgrade reindex Searches


Scenario: View Web Content Archive 6012
Priority: 5
	Given these properties
		|data.archive.type|data-archive-web-content-draft|
	When these properties
		|portal.version|6.0.12|
	And Upgrade add WC Structure And Template
	Then Upgrade publish WC Draft

